WEBVTT

00:15.520 --> 00:18.880
[Eight years ago]

00:47.200 --> 00:47.840
Jiaxian.

00:48.980 --> 00:49.860
Did you

00:50.640 --> 00:51.720
go see Mr. Du?

00:54.030 --> 00:55.160
This is my business.

00:55.600 --> 00:56.400
Stay out of it.

00:56.640 --> 00:57.840
Since we've tied the knot,

00:57.840 --> 00:58.750
we're husband and wife.

00:58.750 --> 01:00.020
Your business is my business.

01:00.020 --> 01:01.280
How can I stay out of it?

01:01.470 --> 01:02.150
Tell me:

01:02.750 --> 01:03.710
what's going on?

01:04.230 --> 01:06.840
It's just spending 20,000 silver dollars
to rebuild Immortal Temple.

01:06.840 --> 01:07.960
As long as Jialiang and Jiashu

01:07.960 --> 01:09.160
can come back safely,

01:09.480 --> 01:11.190
there's nothing I can't give up.

01:11.190 --> 01:13.350
That blind man Du
told you this, didn't he?

01:13.350 --> 01:14.680
Haven't you considered

01:15.160 --> 01:16.570
that he might be lying to you?

01:16.570 --> 01:17.910
I don't care if he's blind or deaf.

01:17.910 --> 01:20.090
You were the ones who made me trust him
in the first place!

01:20.090 --> 01:22.560
Why is it doing a good deed
when you believe him,

01:22.560 --> 01:24.020
but being fooled when I do?

01:24.640 --> 01:24.970
No...

01:25.920 --> 01:27.710
These are two different things.

01:27.710 --> 01:29.330
What if we lose our entire fortune

01:29.330 --> 01:30.789
-and still can't save—
-Jiang Feiyan!

01:30.789 --> 01:33.240
Are the lives of my brother and sister
more important,

01:33.240 --> 01:34.960
or is our family's money?

01:41.870 --> 01:42.509
I'm sorry.

01:43.640 --> 01:44.240
I'm sorry.

01:44.890 --> 01:46.060
I didn't mean that.

01:46.560 --> 01:47.430
I've been...

01:48.350 --> 01:49.080
I've been...

01:49.229 --> 01:49.759
Alright.

01:49.880 --> 01:51.479
Everything's been counted.

01:58.539 --> 01:59.870
If you want to help me,

02:01.920 --> 02:03.580
take good care of Stepmother.

02:03.680 --> 02:04.210
Jiaxian.

02:04.680 --> 02:05.080
Jia...

03:58.230 --> 04:01.930
[A Prophet]

04:02.770 --> 04:04.850
[Episode 3]

04:05.680 --> 04:07.680
You hit the nail on the head, Master.

04:07.810 --> 04:08.800
Sure enough, Chen Jiarong

04:08.800 --> 04:11.280
wasn't about to let me
monopolize the gold mine.

04:11.280 --> 04:13.150
It's to be expected.

04:13.420 --> 04:15.840
Once we get our hands on that
50,000 silver dollars from the mine sale,

04:15.840 --> 04:17.440
shouldn't we reel in the net?

04:18.500 --> 04:19.820
You're too impatient.

04:20.190 --> 04:21.720
This is just the beginning.

04:21.870 --> 04:23.870
We must always finish what we start.

04:24.040 --> 04:25.560
After all the work we put into this setup,

04:25.560 --> 04:27.160
we have to stick the landing.

04:27.920 --> 04:29.240
So you mean...

04:29.300 --> 04:30.500
Play your role

04:30.800 --> 04:32.560
as Lin Shengxiang well.

04:33.060 --> 04:35.659
I'll keep you informed about the rest.

04:40.510 --> 04:41.120
Uncle,

04:41.800 --> 04:43.200
I've thought it through.

04:43.950 --> 04:44.830
This mine...

04:46.680 --> 04:48.080
should all belong to you.

04:48.430 --> 04:49.600
What are you saying?

04:50.310 --> 04:51.870
We agreed on half and half,

04:52.000 --> 04:53.560
but now you're giving it all to me?

04:53.560 --> 04:54.830
If word gets out,

04:55.159 --> 04:57.040
what will people say about me?

04:57.120 --> 04:57.630
Uncle,

04:58.240 --> 04:59.970
this has nothing to do with you.

05:00.310 --> 05:01.770
It's entirely voluntary.

05:03.000 --> 05:04.330
What exactly happened?

05:07.000 --> 05:08.070
Mr. Lin,

05:08.480 --> 05:09.920
there's darkness between your brows.

05:09.920 --> 05:11.720
It seems misfortune is upon you.

05:12.190 --> 05:13.510
Your surname Lin comprises Wood.

05:13.510 --> 05:15.000
You're born under the Fire element.

05:15.000 --> 05:17.390
Wood and Fire are in bright harmony,
and the Bing Fire is fierce.

05:17.390 --> 05:20.070
If it were a tin mine,
you could run it.

05:20.710 --> 05:22.270
But a gold mine,

05:23.800 --> 05:25.190
for you,

05:26.920 --> 05:28.630
would be a disaster.

05:28.870 --> 05:30.070
Oh, please.

05:30.310 --> 05:31.800
That's sheer nonsense.

05:31.950 --> 05:33.040
But what Mr. Song said before

05:33.040 --> 05:34.480
all came true.

05:35.430 --> 05:36.310
Anyway,

05:36.900 --> 05:39.560
I wouldn't dare take on this mine
no matter what.

05:39.640 --> 05:40.500
How about this?

05:41.510 --> 05:42.570
I'll take this mine

05:42.600 --> 05:43.600
for now.

05:43.950 --> 05:45.159
No matter what,

05:45.630 --> 05:46.720
I'll refund

05:46.870 --> 05:49.270
your principal to you in full first.

05:52.290 --> 05:53.409
Thank you, Uncle.

06:37.159 --> 06:38.360
Song Tiezui,

06:39.430 --> 06:40.830
Immortal Song,

06:41.300 --> 06:43.070
you're truly divine.

06:43.360 --> 06:44.390
President Chen,

06:44.390 --> 06:46.270
please don't make fun of me.

06:46.680 --> 06:48.390
In our line of work,

06:48.510 --> 06:51.490
we take people's money
to ward off disasters for them.

06:51.490 --> 06:52.880
I swear to the heavens

06:53.390 --> 06:55.120
that helping you this time

06:55.200 --> 06:56.930
will cost me 10 years of my life.

06:59.390 --> 07:00.320
What do you mean?

07:00.600 --> 07:01.000
I...

07:01.170 --> 07:03.330
You're okay with deceiving others

07:03.630 --> 07:04.870
for Hu Guangyuan,

07:05.360 --> 07:06.360
but not for me?

07:06.920 --> 07:07.480
No...

07:07.690 --> 07:08.860
Listen up.

07:08.890 --> 07:11.000
I saw right through you

07:11.000 --> 07:13.720
the moment you took Hu Guangyuan's money

07:13.830 --> 07:16.490
and recommended the tin mine
to Lin Shengxiang.

07:16.520 --> 07:18.400
Only Lin Shengxiang is stupid enough

07:18.400 --> 07:20.130
to believe everything you say.

07:20.480 --> 07:22.630
I did take Hu Guangyuan's money,

07:23.240 --> 07:25.800
but from a feng shui perspective,

07:25.920 --> 07:27.160
that mine is a treasure land.

07:27.160 --> 07:28.430
I didn't lie,

07:28.870 --> 07:31.040
and gold was indeed found.

07:31.040 --> 07:32.150
Rubbish!

07:33.720 --> 07:36.310
You're just a blind cat
who found a dead mouse.

07:50.390 --> 07:51.320
President Chen,

07:51.920 --> 07:53.680
we agreed on 500 yuan.

07:53.750 --> 07:55.240
Why did it become 100 yuan?

07:55.480 --> 07:56.190
What?

07:58.270 --> 07:59.390
You think 100 is too little?

07:59.390 --> 08:00.800
It's 400 short.

08:00.820 --> 08:01.340
Fine.

08:01.630 --> 08:04.070
Let's go talk to Lin Shengxiang together

08:04.310 --> 08:07.070
and see if he's willing to
give you another 500.

09:00.840 --> 09:01.770
You're leaving?

09:06.240 --> 09:07.500
I'm leaving tomorrow.

09:07.960 --> 09:08.960
So soon?

09:14.480 --> 09:15.410
Back to Pujiang?

09:20.810 --> 09:21.720
San Francisco.

09:24.120 --> 09:24.870
That's far.

09:33.800 --> 09:35.260
What about your business?

09:37.460 --> 09:38.670
Something's been

09:39.670 --> 09:40.830
bugging me about

09:41.260 --> 09:42.120
that gold mine.

09:42.920 --> 09:44.520
Do you want to reconsider?

09:49.150 --> 09:52.030
There are other businesses
besides gold mining.

09:53.750 --> 09:55.120
We can open a factory.

09:56.010 --> 09:56.770
I heard...

09:56.800 --> 09:58.400
I just don't want this matter

10:01.000 --> 10:03.400
to cause a rift between
you and your father.

10:07.970 --> 10:08.850
I'm sorry.

10:11.750 --> 10:12.670
As you know,

10:14.640 --> 10:16.120
Daddy's a businessman.

10:17.020 --> 10:19.950
Actually, he didn't really
cheat me out of anything.

10:20.750 --> 10:23.000
Look, I haven't lost a single cent.

10:24.630 --> 10:26.430
What about what you promised me?

10:28.360 --> 10:29.000
Which is?

10:31.120 --> 10:32.320
I'm still waiting...

10:37.240 --> 10:38.770
for the ending of the story.

10:41.660 --> 10:42.260
Sorry.

10:44.600 --> 10:46.330
I haven't finished writing it.

10:50.080 --> 10:51.010
Lin Shengxiang,

10:51.440 --> 10:52.720
are you really stupid

10:53.270 --> 10:54.600
or just playing dumb?

11:01.030 --> 11:02.750
At the bar where we first met,

11:04.240 --> 11:05.550
I left a gift for you.

11:08.030 --> 11:09.890
First thing tomorrow morning...

11:11.030 --> 11:12.290
remember to pick it up.

11:18.420 --> 11:24.810
[Chen's Mining Plant]

11:36.360 --> 11:37.270
Any gold?

11:38.150 --> 11:39.440
Any gold?

11:39.870 --> 11:40.730
Any over there?

11:41.750 --> 11:42.840
Noticed any gold?

11:43.390 --> 11:45.120
Are these all stones?

11:45.320 --> 11:46.550
Where's my gold?

11:46.750 --> 11:47.670
Keep digging!

11:48.150 --> 11:49.480
Dig with all your might!

11:49.720 --> 11:51.720
I must see gold, even if we have to

11:51.720 --> 11:53.360
hollow out this mountain!

11:53.940 --> 11:54.490
Dig!

11:55.000 --> 11:55.960
Don't stop!

11:56.390 --> 11:58.460
Keep digging!

12:40.510 --> 12:41.600
Where's my gold?

12:41.620 --> 12:42.340
Mr. Chen,

12:42.710 --> 12:44.490
we've sifted 10 buckets in a row.

12:44.490 --> 12:45.450
It's all stones.

12:45.600 --> 12:47.600
Not a single grain of gold was found.

12:52.460 --> 12:54.100
Mr. Chen!

12:59.250 --> 13:00.410
Search thoroughly!

13:00.870 --> 13:02.270
Don't let anyone escape!

13:02.320 --> 13:03.180
Director Zhao,

13:03.300 --> 13:05.180
I'll leave this matter to you.

13:05.240 --> 13:07.490
You must catch those three swindlers.

13:07.510 --> 13:09.230
I'll reward you handsomely.

13:09.510 --> 13:10.960
You're too kind, President Chen.

13:10.960 --> 13:12.150
I've sent people to

13:12.170 --> 13:13.830
all the places you mentioned—

13:13.870 --> 13:15.000
Hu Guangyuan's house,

13:15.000 --> 13:16.480
Song Bingzhang's fortune-telling parlor—

13:16.480 --> 13:17.750
but there was no one there.

13:17.750 --> 13:19.350
Everything's been emptied out.

13:19.350 --> 13:21.350
If those three aren't caught,

13:21.880 --> 13:25.240
I, Chen Jiarong, will become
the laughingstock of Pangzhou.

13:25.240 --> 13:27.360
Don't worry. I'll deploy more men to

13:27.590 --> 13:29.870
keep a close watch on
all the stations and docks in the city.

13:29.870 --> 13:31.240
They can't escape.

13:33.170 --> 13:40.380
[Guanghe Warehouse]

13:36.550 --> 13:37.320
Get off.

13:37.480 --> 13:38.200
Right here.

13:54.550 --> 13:56.600
Fine feathers make fine birds.

13:56.910 --> 13:58.200
Go pick out an outfit.

13:59.440 --> 14:00.440
How is it, Senior?

14:00.500 --> 14:01.670
This photo's good.

14:01.960 --> 14:03.090
His eyes look great.

14:03.390 --> 14:05.120
You have to call him Master too.

14:05.230 --> 14:07.040
Song Bingzhang is my senior.

14:05.870 --> 14:07.650
[Song Bingzhang of Tianxiang Sect]

14:07.240 --> 14:08.760
Alright, time's up.

14:09.150 --> 14:10.870
Everyone, please go back.

14:11.270 --> 14:12.200
Song Tiezui,

14:12.550 --> 14:13.630
Immortal Song,

14:13.910 --> 14:15.600
you're truly divine.

14:15.630 --> 14:17.030
I didn't lie.

14:19.240 --> 14:20.750
100,000 silver dollars

14:21.150 --> 14:22.610
all turned into gold bars.

14:23.480 --> 14:25.010
We made a fortune this time.

14:25.200 --> 14:26.000
Junior,

14:26.120 --> 14:28.380
it's all thanks to your strategic vision

14:28.630 --> 14:30.160
and impeccable foresight.

14:30.960 --> 14:33.690
Chen Jiarong is hunting us down
all over the city.

14:34.080 --> 14:36.680
Is this warehouse
we prepared in advance safe?

14:37.960 --> 14:39.440
I've arranged for the Chen family

14:39.440 --> 14:41.240
to head to the docks and stations.

14:41.240 --> 14:42.550
This place is remote.

14:42.630 --> 14:44.670
No one will think of coming here.

14:46.200 --> 14:47.200
Do you think

14:47.320 --> 14:49.600
that old fart would fall for it so easily,

14:49.720 --> 14:51.720
believing there's gold in the mine?

14:52.360 --> 14:53.750
He's one of us.

14:52.980 --> 14:54.670
[Zhu Wangfu of Tianxiang Sect]

14:54.720 --> 14:56.600
I thought of finding one of our own to

14:56.600 --> 14:57.660
disguise as a miner

14:57.670 --> 14:59.800
and ask around at the Hu family's mine.

15:00.240 --> 15:02.040
You really think ahead, Master.

15:02.200 --> 15:03.330
I'm very impressed.

15:03.360 --> 15:04.750
You did a decent job too.

15:05.150 --> 15:06.750
Come on. How much do I owe you?

15:08.600 --> 15:10.000
100 silver dollars a day,

15:10.360 --> 15:11.560
for a total of 10 days.

15:11.790 --> 15:13.790
Plus a bonus of 1,000 silver dollars,

15:13.790 --> 15:14.630
that makes a total of

15:14.630 --> 15:15.890
2,000 silver dollars.

15:17.960 --> 15:18.550
Gui,

15:18.910 --> 15:19.710
give it to him.

15:21.510 --> 15:21.910
Here.

15:22.600 --> 15:23.440
For you.

15:24.030 --> 15:24.630
Take it!

15:25.440 --> 15:26.000
Master,

15:26.750 --> 15:27.810
what's this about?

15:33.240 --> 15:33.970
Originally,

15:34.320 --> 15:35.790
we didn't have to kill you.

15:36.390 --> 15:39.030
But you've caused us trouble
time and again,

15:39.030 --> 15:40.490
always acting on your own.

15:40.840 --> 15:43.030
Besides, you know too much.

15:43.240 --> 15:45.030
Keeping you alive is a threat.

15:45.060 --> 15:45.700
Am I right?

15:45.910 --> 15:46.480
Master,

15:47.080 --> 15:49.030
according to Tianxiang Sect's rules,

15:49.030 --> 15:50.490
killing fellow disciples

15:50.650 --> 15:51.850
is a capital offense.

15:55.320 --> 15:56.930
We are fellow disciples.

15:57.600 --> 15:58.600
You are not.

15:59.270 --> 16:00.910
You're just a nobody.

16:13.600 --> 16:15.000
What are you laughing at?

16:15.080 --> 16:16.510
Before I left home today,

16:17.010 --> 16:18.410
I told my own fortune.

16:18.720 --> 16:19.910
The hexagram said

16:19.910 --> 16:21.570
I'm not destined to die today.

16:21.670 --> 16:23.200
Whoever tries to kill me

16:23.830 --> 16:25.080
will also end up dead.

16:25.910 --> 16:27.670
You can even tell fortunes?

16:28.240 --> 16:29.630
Then let's see how accurate

16:29.630 --> 16:31.390
your fortune-telling is.

16:31.480 --> 16:32.010
Alright,

16:32.150 --> 16:33.150
enough nonsense.

16:33.150 --> 16:33.600
Gui.

16:36.670 --> 16:37.510
You

16:38.750 --> 16:41.000
are just a big idiot!

16:53.750 --> 16:55.000
Freeze!

16:55.190 --> 16:57.320
Things are getting tense! Let's bail!

17:09.550 --> 17:10.109
Freeze!

17:10.270 --> 17:11.000
Freeze!

17:12.270 --> 17:13.000
Freeze!

17:19.160 --> 17:20.510
Freeze!

17:22.700 --> 17:23.700
Don't shoot!

17:24.810 --> 17:26.410
Freeze!

17:44.680 --> 17:46.350
At the bar where we first met,

17:47.030 --> 17:48.240
I left a gift for you.

17:49.030 --> 17:50.500
First thing tomorrow morning,

17:50.500 --> 17:51.680
remember to pick it up.

17:51.680 --> 17:52.350
Miss Chen.

17:53.440 --> 17:54.040
Miss Chen?

17:55.070 --> 17:57.070
Mr. Lin asked me to give this to you.

18:04.420 --> 18:05.910
[Chen Qingying]

18:09.830 --> 18:11.830
[Target Profile]

18:19.200 --> 18:19.880
Hello.

18:20.440 --> 18:22.110
I was hired for 100 silver dollars a day

18:22.110 --> 18:23.400
to win you over.

18:23.830 --> 18:26.200
I've never heard this pickup line before.

18:26.550 --> 18:27.280
I'm serious.

18:27.360 --> 18:29.050
And I agreed to it.

18:29.720 --> 18:31.350
You're quite interesting.

18:31.960 --> 18:33.690
Saving the damsel in distress?

18:34.110 --> 18:34.960
So cliché.

18:35.550 --> 18:36.590
It is a bit cliché.

18:37.440 --> 18:38.310
But...

18:40.200 --> 18:42.330
there are always fools who fall for it.

18:53.110 --> 18:55.750
[East Suburb Warehouse 405]

19:02.790 --> 19:03.400
Wait.

19:04.200 --> 19:04.790
Officer.

19:05.270 --> 19:06.800
I have something to report.

19:07.030 --> 19:08.110
Why isn't he arrested?

19:08.110 --> 19:08.960
He's a fraud too.

19:08.960 --> 19:10.090
We're accomplices.

19:10.350 --> 19:12.350
His real name isn't Lin Shengxiang.

19:12.510 --> 19:13.440
It's Lyu Ruhui.

19:13.510 --> 19:15.110
I brought him back from Pujiang.

19:15.110 --> 19:16.270
In this situation,

19:16.680 --> 19:18.740
you're still trying to frame Mr. Lin.

19:19.270 --> 19:21.930
You really won't quit
until the bitter end, huh?

19:23.200 --> 19:24.530
Take a good look at this.

19:24.750 --> 19:25.750
His passport and ID document

19:25.750 --> 19:27.480
were found at the hotel.

19:27.920 --> 19:29.050
It's been verified.

19:29.590 --> 19:31.050
There's no doubt about it!

19:34.720 --> 19:36.270
I hunted eagles all my life,

19:36.830 --> 19:39.560
only to have my eyes pecked out
by a house sparrow.

19:40.000 --> 19:40.960
Young fellow,

19:41.640 --> 19:42.590
you're good.

19:43.830 --> 19:44.690
Take them away!

19:55.510 --> 19:56.370
Director Zhao.

20:04.190 --> 20:05.190
Gentlemen,

20:05.220 --> 20:06.060
look here.

20:36.880 --> 20:38.140
Those two ID documents

20:38.640 --> 20:39.880
are fake.

20:42.310 --> 20:43.480
Who on earth are you?

20:48.240 --> 20:49.840
Since you know they're fake,

20:51.720 --> 20:53.450
why did you save a fraud like me?

20:59.000 --> 21:00.530
What did you cheat me out of?

21:02.160 --> 21:02.750
My money,

21:04.510 --> 21:05.070
my body,

21:05.590 --> 21:06.590
or my feelings?

21:10.720 --> 21:12.270
Don't be fooled again.

21:14.510 --> 21:15.880
You're luckier than me.

21:18.000 --> 21:19.930
At least you didn't lose anything.

21:20.110 --> 21:21.960
I want to know how the story ends.

21:24.040 --> 21:25.230
The real ending.

21:29.530 --> 21:30.240
Fine.

21:34.110 --> 21:35.560
I'll tell you now.

21:40.050 --> 21:43.880
[Eight years ago]

21:43.510 --> 21:45.070
Mr. Du, Mr. Du,

21:45.680 --> 21:47.000
here's 20,000 silver dollars.

21:47.000 --> 21:48.750
I've wiped out my entire life savings.

21:48.750 --> 21:50.350
Please save my brother and sister.

21:50.350 --> 21:51.640
I've already told you

21:52.270 --> 21:54.030
that the money isn't for me.

21:54.310 --> 21:56.170
It's for you to rebuild the temple

21:56.270 --> 21:58.070
and worship the Immortal Elder.

21:59.920 --> 22:00.720
I understand.

22:01.270 --> 22:02.070
I understand.

22:02.960 --> 22:04.240
Please take action as soon as possible.

22:04.240 --> 22:05.960
Being in seclusion for 7 days,

22:05.980 --> 22:08.620
I've heard some divine whisper
in the mist.

22:09.070 --> 22:10.930
But I still have to ask the founder

22:10.940 --> 22:13.660
if I can tell you this information.

22:27.910 --> 22:29.510
Come forward and take a look.

22:35.510 --> 22:36.970
A moonlit night on the 15th

22:37.350 --> 22:38.510
by the Nanxi River,

22:39.160 --> 22:40.960
the immortal children descend.

22:40.960 --> 22:42.290
Against the current...

22:43.110 --> 22:44.440
Against the current...

22:44.510 --> 22:46.640
I can't see the last few words clearly.

22:47.110 --> 22:48.640
A moonlit night on the 15th?

22:49.160 --> 22:50.290
Isn't that tonight?

22:53.510 --> 22:55.710
Since the founder answered the prayer,

22:56.160 --> 22:57.240
go to Nanxi River

22:57.590 --> 22:58.920
at midnight tonight,

22:59.310 --> 23:01.510
and you'll see your brother and sister.

23:04.680 --> 23:06.310
What does "immortal children descending"

23:06.310 --> 23:07.310
mean?

23:07.550 --> 23:08.590
Go,

23:08.790 --> 23:10.110
and you'll know.

23:12.310 --> 23:13.640
The river's flowing backwards,

23:13.640 --> 23:16.070
and the corpses are drifting
from downstream to upstream.

23:16.070 --> 23:18.000
I've never seen
such a spooky thing before.

23:18.000 --> 23:19.310
Mr. Du said it's the sins

23:19.310 --> 23:20.550
committed by the Wangs...

23:20.550 --> 23:21.160
Jialiang!

23:21.400 --> 23:22.480
That angered the Immortal Elder.

23:22.480 --> 23:23.000
Jiashu!

23:23.000 --> 23:24.240
We'd better pool our money quickly

23:24.240 --> 23:25.550
to repair the Immortal Temple.

23:25.550 --> 23:26.550
Mr. Du said that

23:26.570 --> 23:28.100
restoring the gold-leaf statue
is the only way

23:28.100 --> 23:29.240
to appease Immortal Elder's anger.

23:29.240 --> 23:29.840
Jialiang!

23:30.550 --> 23:31.240
Jiashu!

23:31.590 --> 23:32.270
Jialiang!

23:32.790 --> 23:33.480
Jiashu!

23:35.070 --> 23:38.200
The immortal children descend.
Against the current, the corpses go.

23:38.200 --> 23:41.350
The immortal children descend.
Against the current, the corpses go.

23:41.350 --> 23:44.640
The immortal children descend.
Against the current, the corpses go.

23:44.640 --> 23:47.920
The immortal children descend.
Against the current, the corpses go.

23:47.920 --> 23:51.200
The immortal children descend.
Against the current, the corpses go.

23:51.200 --> 23:55.060
The immortal children descend.
Against the current, the corpses go.

23:56.400 --> 23:57.200
Jialiang!

23:57.750 --> 23:58.480
Jiashu!

24:11.480 --> 24:12.270
Jialiang!

24:12.640 --> 24:13.370
Jiashu!

25:39.000 --> 25:39.600
Jialiang.

25:41.510 --> 25:42.200
Jiashu.

25:45.480 --> 25:46.310
Wang Jiaxian!

25:46.550 --> 25:47.810
Your lack of reverence

25:47.880 --> 25:49.070
enraged Immortal Elder!

25:49.070 --> 25:51.310
Now the whole town has to live in fear!

25:51.480 --> 25:52.240
Get out!

25:52.400 --> 25:53.160
Get out now!

25:53.350 --> 25:54.920
Get out, you jinx!

25:54.920 --> 25:56.850
Immortal Elder wants
the lives of you Wangs!

25:56.850 --> 25:58.850
We're innocent! Don't drag us down!

25:59.240 --> 26:00.160
Get out!

26:03.440 --> 26:05.750
Your brother and sister
died in your place!

26:05.750 --> 26:09.200
The corpses floating upstream is
Immortal Elder manifesting to take lives!

26:09.200 --> 26:10.790
You're next!

26:10.880 --> 26:11.920
Get out now!

26:38.310 --> 26:39.030
Feiyan.

26:40.750 --> 26:41.480
Feiyan!

26:43.240 --> 26:44.350
Feiyan!

26:45.550 --> 26:46.640
Feiyan!

26:47.720 --> 26:48.590
Feiyan?

26:59.830 --> 27:00.590
Stepmother.

27:08.350 --> 27:09.080
Stepmother.

27:13.200 --> 27:13.960
Stepmother.

27:21.960 --> 27:22.830
Jiaxian.

27:26.590 --> 27:27.400
Jialiang...

27:29.110 --> 27:30.160
and Jiashu...

27:33.960 --> 27:36.510
are dead!

27:36.650 --> 27:37.480
Stepmother!

27:50.510 --> 27:51.350
Stepmother.

27:57.350 --> 27:57.950
Talisman.

27:59.470 --> 28:00.040
Talisman.

28:00.040 --> 28:00.770
Stepmother.

28:05.090 --> 28:05.680
Stepmother!

28:05.680 --> 28:07.200
What are you doing?

28:10.590 --> 28:11.480
Jiaxian.

28:13.270 --> 28:14.160
It was me...

28:16.030 --> 28:17.510
who killed your father.

28:18.270 --> 28:19.030
Stepmother.

28:20.830 --> 28:22.360
What are you talking about?

28:22.370 --> 28:24.760
That blind man Du made me do it.

28:25.440 --> 28:27.480
He gave me all these talismans.

28:27.960 --> 28:29.110
He told me

28:29.640 --> 28:31.350
to burn them to ashes

28:31.680 --> 28:33.810
and secretly feed them to your father.

28:46.640 --> 28:47.500
Stepmother...

28:49.280 --> 28:50.610
Are you out of your mind?

28:50.680 --> 28:52.240
Only by doing this

28:54.030 --> 28:56.240
would your father love me and only me.

28:56.720 --> 28:57.650
All these years,

28:58.400 --> 29:00.330
had my father not treated you well?

29:01.750 --> 29:02.610
Your father...

29:05.240 --> 29:06.830
did treat me very well.

29:10.110 --> 29:12.310
You also treated me like your own mother

29:13.400 --> 29:15.460
and doted on your brother and sister.

29:16.080 --> 29:18.750
I've been married into the Wang family
for so many years,

29:18.750 --> 29:20.550
had two children,

29:21.070 --> 29:22.920
managed the household,

29:23.510 --> 29:25.480
and raised you three.

29:26.000 --> 29:27.400
But I've always...

29:30.000 --> 29:31.790
remained an outsider.

29:32.400 --> 29:33.200
Stepmother!

29:34.920 --> 29:36.200
What are you saying?

29:37.880 --> 29:39.810
Your father thought I didn't know.

29:41.110 --> 29:42.960
He only married me

29:45.670 --> 29:47.910
because I look like your mother.

29:48.630 --> 29:49.500
Your mother

29:50.260 --> 29:51.870
has been dead for 20 years.

29:52.300 --> 29:53.950
But in this house...

29:56.950 --> 29:58.830
I'm just her replacement...

30:00.700 --> 30:02.220
her shadow.

30:06.350 --> 30:07.430
Do you know that

30:09.350 --> 30:10.880
when your father got drunk,

30:13.110 --> 30:15.670
he only called your mother's name?

30:16.700 --> 30:18.110
I'm a woman.

30:19.190 --> 30:20.910
I have no other desires.

30:21.430 --> 30:23.690
I just wanted your father to love only me,

30:23.740 --> 30:26.150
to stop seeing me as just a replacement!

30:26.300 --> 30:27.830
Is it wrong of me to have just this

30:27.830 --> 30:29.350
one little selfish wish?

30:30.220 --> 30:32.260
I didn't expect that

30:33.060 --> 30:35.190
this tiny bit of selfishness...

30:37.220 --> 30:39.280
would result in your father's death.

30:41.780 --> 30:42.700
Your father

30:43.110 --> 30:44.700
hated my guts.

30:46.780 --> 30:47.500
So,

30:49.260 --> 30:51.430
he took Jialiang and Jiashu away.

30:52.630 --> 30:54.700
He's punishing me.

30:55.780 --> 30:56.700
Stepmother,

30:57.110 --> 30:58.700
please come to your senses.

31:00.910 --> 31:03.300
I didn't take good care of this family.

31:04.220 --> 31:06.220
I let the Wang family down.

31:10.980 --> 31:13.220
I also let your father down.

31:14.950 --> 31:15.910
Your mother too.

31:17.430 --> 31:18.960
When I get to the other side,

31:19.670 --> 31:20.670
I will

31:21.300 --> 31:22.390
kowtow to them

31:23.110 --> 31:24.390
and apologize.

31:24.910 --> 31:25.640
Stepmother.

31:26.500 --> 31:27.230
Stepmother.

31:27.670 --> 31:28.400
Stepmother.

31:29.260 --> 31:29.990
Stepmother.

31:30.870 --> 31:31.600
Stepmother.

31:39.300 --> 31:40.630
That wife of yours

31:42.060 --> 31:43.590
isn't coming back.

31:45.830 --> 31:47.260
By the river,

31:48.300 --> 31:50.390
I saw her walking away...

31:52.430 --> 31:53.390
alone.

32:07.090 --> 32:13.670
♪ Under the old city wall,
that year the rain fell gently ♪

32:08.670 --> 32:10.910
This story is very tragic.

32:12.220 --> 32:13.750
But it's not over yet, is it?

32:14.240 --> 32:20.200
♪ You walked by with an umbrella,
saying loneliness didn't scare you ♪

32:16.460 --> 32:17.430
I don't know.

32:20.220 --> 32:21.630
Maybe it's already over.

32:21.270 --> 32:27.580
♪ Later, a blade lay hidden
within a smile ♪

32:24.590 --> 32:26.350
Maybe it's just begun.

32:28.830 --> 32:36.080
♪ An impulsive, spiteful remark
cut deep into my heart ♪

32:36.490 --> 32:42.110
♪ You know full well how weak I am ♪

32:37.670 --> 32:38.430
Shengxiang,

32:39.430 --> 32:41.020
I know this story

32:42.640 --> 32:44.820
♪ Yet you always turn around ♪

32:43.060 --> 32:44.300
doesn't belong to me.

32:44.850 --> 32:50.640
♪ Shielding me from
harsh words and cold daggers ♪

32:45.460 --> 32:47.220
But the scenery I saw with you

32:47.910 --> 32:49.950
while listening to it...

32:51.780 --> 32:55.230
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

32:52.950 --> 32:54.430
I will always remember.

32:55.290 --> 32:58.190
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

32:58.840 --> 33:02.350
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

33:02.370 --> 33:04.940
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

33:05.740 --> 33:09.290
♪ May you find your way out
of the haze that is us ♪

33:09.320 --> 33:12.010
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

33:12.790 --> 33:16.180
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

33:15.590 --> 33:16.390
I will, too.

33:16.250 --> 33:21.160
♪ I shall bloom for you in silence ♪

33:37.910 --> 33:39.260
I spent some money

33:39.870 --> 33:41.400
to buy those two scoundrels

33:41.500 --> 33:43.910
back from Director Zhao.

33:44.740 --> 33:45.430
Fraud will

33:46.110 --> 33:48.150
get them three years at most.

33:48.630 --> 33:51.230
I'm not letting two bastards
get off that easy.

33:52.110 --> 33:52.950
I see.

33:55.220 --> 33:56.350
But you know what?

33:57.060 --> 33:58.460
The one I hate the most...

34:01.590 --> 34:03.150
is actually you.

34:04.460 --> 34:06.500
If Qingying hadn't pleaded for you,

34:07.190 --> 34:09.659
you'd be down there right now too.

34:15.750 --> 34:17.949
After going around in such a big circle,

34:18.310 --> 34:20.830
my money is still my money,

34:21.060 --> 34:24.620
and the four swindlers
are still four swindlers.

34:24.980 --> 34:26.270
What are you after?

34:32.610 --> 34:34.489
It's them you're after.

34:35.270 --> 34:36.330
You could say that.

34:38.429 --> 34:39.580
Even so,

34:39.659 --> 34:41.350
you shouldn't have lied to me,

34:41.350 --> 34:43.350
let alone deceive Qingying!

34:43.380 --> 34:45.050
You scumbag!

34:48.659 --> 34:50.260
Qingying's a good woman.

34:50.980 --> 34:52.060
I let her down.

34:57.210 --> 34:58.610
But you being scammed...

35:02.620 --> 35:03.660
You deserved it.

35:06.230 --> 35:07.950
If I'm not mistaken,

35:09.180 --> 35:11.350
when Qingying first approached me,

35:11.710 --> 35:14.660
you were pulling the strings
behind the scenes, right?

35:14.660 --> 35:15.790
After that,

35:15.910 --> 35:17.500
you were the one playing both sides,

35:17.500 --> 35:19.910
and you were the one who
wanted the gold mine to yourself.

35:19.910 --> 35:21.540
If you hadn't been greedy,

35:22.710 --> 35:24.390
who could've scammed

35:25.950 --> 35:27.500
a single penny from you?

35:36.500 --> 35:37.980
You're not the first scammer

35:37.980 --> 35:39.350
I've met.

35:39.750 --> 35:41.140
But a scammer

35:41.910 --> 35:44.980
so self-righteous is really a first.

35:45.180 --> 35:47.230
But I've seen plenty of

35:48.620 --> 35:50.430
hypocrites like you.

35:56.790 --> 35:57.950
Whatever.

35:59.660 --> 36:00.830
Whatever.

36:16.620 --> 36:17.980
What are you doing here?

36:20.460 --> 36:22.320
I'm here to ask you about someone.

36:23.620 --> 36:24.790
Who?

36:25.500 --> 36:26.540
He's surnamed Du,

36:27.540 --> 36:28.740
in his early fifties,

36:29.270 --> 36:30.540
and he's blind.

36:32.420 --> 36:34.100
Who exactly are you?

36:35.500 --> 36:37.270
I'm the one asking questions.

36:37.660 --> 36:39.870
You just have to answer me.

36:40.230 --> 36:40.830
Then...

36:41.230 --> 36:42.230
Don't say a thing.

36:42.790 --> 36:44.660
If... If I tell you,

36:44.980 --> 36:46.710
what's in it for us?

36:47.310 --> 36:48.950
That old fart Chen Jiarong

36:48.980 --> 36:50.350
gave me this authority:

36:50.980 --> 36:52.750
whoever answers my question,

36:53.310 --> 36:54.870
I'll let him go.

36:55.980 --> 36:56.870
But

36:57.460 --> 36:58.990
I can only let one person go.

36:59.180 --> 37:01.140
Don't believe him, Senior.

37:01.140 --> 37:02.540
Don't say anything.

37:04.640 --> 37:06.040
Neither of you will talk?

37:08.230 --> 37:09.350
Then

37:10.230 --> 37:11.560
you'll both have to die.

37:17.830 --> 37:18.540
Goodbye.

37:22.230 --> 37:24.130
Can you give us some water to drink?

37:24.130 --> 37:25.620
The person you're looking for

37:25.620 --> 37:26.500
is Du Binghui!

37:26.500 --> 37:27.790
Shut up!

37:27.790 --> 37:29.020
Junior, this is unbearable.

37:29.020 --> 37:29.910
Song Bingzhang!

37:29.910 --> 37:30.620
Don't speak!

37:30.620 --> 37:30.950
Shut up!

37:30.950 --> 37:32.140
He's my master!

37:32.140 --> 37:34.470
He's the grandmaster of Longxuya Branch!

37:34.620 --> 37:36.350
He's currently in Qianshan.

37:36.500 --> 37:37.540
I'm his eldest disciple.

37:37.540 --> 37:38.980
He trusts me the most!

37:38.980 --> 37:40.140
Take me out of here,

37:40.140 --> 37:41.660
and I'll help you kill him!

37:41.660 --> 37:42.910
Song Bingzhang!

37:43.100 --> 37:44.460
Use your brain!

37:44.710 --> 37:46.910
The one we offended is Chen Jiarong.

37:46.980 --> 37:48.180
Our lives

37:48.230 --> 37:49.790
are not up to him!

37:50.910 --> 37:52.180
He's right.

37:52.980 --> 37:54.230
Your lives

37:54.500 --> 37:56.460
are indeed not up to me.

37:57.790 --> 37:58.620
Goodbye!

37:59.870 --> 38:00.980
Come back!

38:01.460 --> 38:02.910
You dirty liar!

38:02.930 --> 38:04.210
Oh, my lord!

38:10.660 --> 38:12.980
Don't show up in Qingying's life
ever again.

38:12.980 --> 38:15.230
Come back here!

38:15.750 --> 38:17.790
You dirty liar!

38:34.950 --> 38:36.230
Turn on the machine.

38:46.140 --> 38:47.670
Send these two fine fellows

38:47.870 --> 38:48.830
on their way.

38:51.870 --> 38:53.390
H-Help!

38:54.180 --> 38:56.050
Help!

38:56.460 --> 38:57.100
Spare me!

38:57.100 --> 38:59.390
I don't want to die!

39:10.950 --> 39:12.210
How's his health been?

39:12.580 --> 39:13.470
He's much better.

39:13.470 --> 39:16.530
Lately, I've been asking him
to take a walk after meals.

39:16.880 --> 39:18.740
Mr. Jin is waiting for you inside.

39:41.060 --> 39:41.910
Mentor.

39:54.060 --> 39:55.700
Looking at your mother's fate blueprint,

39:55.700 --> 39:58.410
I'm afraid she won't survive this time.

39:58.900 --> 40:00.860
Master, I beg you.

40:00.950 --> 40:01.950
Please save my mother.

40:01.950 --> 40:03.390
If you don't help me,

40:03.390 --> 40:05.140
my mother will die!

40:05.900 --> 40:07.490
Master, please help him.

40:07.620 --> 40:10.060
Please help him.

40:10.460 --> 40:12.390
If you believe him...

40:14.710 --> 40:16.660
your mother will really die.

40:17.140 --> 40:18.870
Do you have a grudge against me?

40:19.020 --> 40:21.020
Why target a fortune teller like me?

40:29.980 --> 40:31.910
I have no grudge against you.

40:34.540 --> 40:35.870
But I know...

40:37.870 --> 40:40.460
you fortune-telling bastards

40:41.100 --> 40:42.270
are all frauds!

40:44.620 --> 40:45.980
You've gone too far!

40:45.980 --> 40:47.140
I'll fight you!

40:47.140 --> 40:48.540
He's bullying an old man!

40:48.540 --> 40:49.020
Sir.

40:49.140 --> 40:50.060
Sir, are you okay?

40:50.060 --> 40:51.460
What are you waiting for?

40:51.500 --> 40:52.230
Get him!

40:56.430 --> 40:57.270
Hit him hard!

41:09.390 --> 41:10.460
Wallop him!

41:10.540 --> 41:11.430
Hit him hard!

41:23.600 --> 41:24.530
We're done here!

42:35.460 --> 42:37.710
This ruined temple is quite eerie.

42:40.230 --> 42:41.180
Come down.

42:42.660 --> 42:43.540
Let's chat.

42:55.620 --> 42:57.100
Your facial features indicate

42:57.100 --> 42:58.900
you have a long life ahead of you.

42:58.910 --> 43:00.040
You won't die today.

43:00.390 --> 43:01.720
Come down and talk to me.

43:03.460 --> 43:04.870
You think? Watch me die

43:06.500 --> 43:08.300
right in front of you today then.

43:44.270 --> 43:44.830
Come on.

43:45.890 --> 43:46.950
Warm up by the fire.

43:54.980 --> 43:56.780
You clearly have no experience.

43:57.870 --> 43:59.060
How could such a thin rope

43:59.060 --> 43:59.920
hold the weight

44:00.060 --> 44:01.430
of a grown man like you?

44:08.270 --> 44:09.100
What?

44:11.530 --> 44:13.390
Have you hanged yourself before?

44:14.620 --> 44:16.430
In these chaotic times,

44:17.140 --> 44:19.660
who hasn't seen a few folks
hang themselves?

44:24.430 --> 44:25.870
Why is it that you want to

44:25.980 --> 44:27.390
end it all?

44:29.300 --> 44:30.900
Aren't you a fortune teller?

44:32.660 --> 44:33.620
Take a guess.

44:37.790 --> 44:39.180
What else could it be?

44:39.580 --> 44:40.980
Loved ones passing away,

44:41.910 --> 44:43.540
one's family falling from grace,

44:43.540 --> 44:45.000
losing people and assets,

44:45.870 --> 44:47.230
or a broken romance.

44:47.750 --> 44:49.140
Life inevitably boils down

44:49.140 --> 44:50.310
to these few things.

44:56.460 --> 44:57.310
Old man...

45:01.500 --> 45:02.760
do you believe in fate?

45:03.350 --> 45:04.310
Of course I do.

45:07.910 --> 45:08.870
Then tell me:

45:11.750 --> 45:14.480
what sins could a person commit
in their past life

45:16.270 --> 45:18.000
to simultaneously experience

45:19.660 --> 45:21.260
his loved ones passing away,

45:22.950 --> 45:24.680
his family falling from grace,

45:25.980 --> 45:27.440
losing people and assets,

45:30.020 --> 45:31.830
and a broken romance?

45:37.430 --> 45:39.950
It seems you're determined to die.

45:41.460 --> 45:43.660
I've been wandering the world for years

45:43.870 --> 45:45.930
and heard many stories of the living.

45:45.980 --> 45:47.640
But the stories of the dead...

45:49.100 --> 45:50.500
I've really never heard.

45:53.350 --> 45:54.280
Tell me about it.

46:07.660 --> 46:09.830
You've been set up.

46:11.830 --> 46:12.620
Set up?

46:13.660 --> 46:15.580
There are many swindlers out there,

46:15.580 --> 46:18.180
but judging from your experience,

46:19.830 --> 46:21.230
it should be

46:21.970 --> 46:24.490
the work of Tianxiang Sect.

46:27.620 --> 46:28.620
Tianxiang Sect?

46:30.750 --> 46:31.480
What is that?

46:32.350 --> 46:33.830
The Tianxiang Sect

46:33.950 --> 46:35.660
is a band of con artists

46:35.830 --> 46:37.460
who use fortune-telling

46:37.620 --> 46:38.750
as a front.

46:39.020 --> 46:41.180
From the moment you met Jiang Feiyan,

46:41.980 --> 46:44.060
you'd already fallen into their trap.

46:44.060 --> 46:45.460
But Jiang Feiyan's an opera singer.

46:45.460 --> 46:47.190
She has nothing to do with this.

46:47.350 --> 46:49.390
The Tianxiang Sect has many members,

46:49.390 --> 46:51.180
and one of their branches is all female.

46:51.180 --> 46:52.620
They don't tell fortunes,

46:52.620 --> 46:55.310
but they use their looks to seduce men

46:55.310 --> 46:56.750
to fleece them.

46:59.750 --> 47:02.210
How do you know so much
about Tianxiang Sect?

47:08.620 --> 47:11.140
I used to be in Tianxiang Sect.

47:18.390 --> 47:20.270
You...

47:36.540 --> 47:37.430
Look,

47:38.460 --> 47:40.640
I have the Tianxiang Sect to thank

47:41.180 --> 47:43.180
for this lame leg.

47:43.870 --> 47:45.580
I slaved away for them,

47:45.830 --> 47:48.180
only to be backstabbed.

47:49.140 --> 47:51.180
Now I've ended up like this.

47:51.950 --> 47:53.350
At my worst,

47:54.180 --> 47:55.460
I was only a breath away

47:56.140 --> 47:57.460
from death.

47:58.270 --> 48:00.000
The only thing keeping me alive

48:00.230 --> 48:01.390
is one thought:

48:03.460 --> 48:04.860
destroy Tianxiang Sect.

48:09.870 --> 48:11.270
Destroy Tianxiang Sect?

48:12.350 --> 48:13.880
With that lame leg of yours,

48:15.390 --> 48:16.790
how can you destroy them?

48:22.660 --> 48:25.320
Physical strength isn't needed
for my revenge.

48:29.620 --> 48:32.140
I know all the tricks of Tianxiang Sect.

48:32.200 --> 48:34.680
They're nothing but charlatans
putting on a supernatural show

48:34.680 --> 48:35.950
to delude people.

48:36.310 --> 48:37.180
Then how did

48:38.310 --> 48:39.910
the Immortal Elder recruit

48:40.580 --> 48:41.840
the child attendants?

48:46.350 --> 48:48.350
Saving countless souls!

48:49.580 --> 48:51.580
The child attendants you saw

48:51.870 --> 48:53.470
must've been living people.

48:54.350 --> 48:56.010
They were alive when they were

48:56.710 --> 48:58.170
sealed into clay statues.

49:00.580 --> 49:02.350
They couldn't speak or move,

49:03.020 --> 49:04.620
and would die

49:04.620 --> 49:05.870
in a few days.

49:06.830 --> 49:07.580
Then...

49:08.910 --> 49:10.300
how did the words materialize

49:10.300 --> 49:13.160
in the incense ash,
becoming a prophecy fulfilled?

49:13.910 --> 49:16.100
It's a little ruse of theirs.

49:16.520 --> 49:19.420
They coated the surface with a solution
and wrote words with their finger,

49:19.420 --> 49:20.680
causing the sprinkled

49:20.900 --> 49:22.490
incense ash to stick and reveal the text.

49:21.310 --> 49:22.440
[Silly]

49:22.750 --> 49:25.180
Then how did they make corpses
drift against the current?

49:25.180 --> 49:26.180
It's very simple.

49:26.810 --> 49:28.070
They had two good swimmers

49:27.140 --> 49:29.680
[Lyu Ruhui]

49:28.460 --> 49:29.590
dive into the water,

49:30.140 --> 49:31.870
using reed stalks to breathe.

49:32.310 --> 49:33.710
The reed stalks are very thin,

49:33.710 --> 49:35.660
so people on the shore
can hardly see them.

49:35.660 --> 49:39.460
This creates the illusion of corpses
drifting against the current.

49:43.390 --> 49:45.320
What are they hoping to achieve...

49:46.750 --> 49:47.750
by doing all this?

49:50.580 --> 49:51.510
Fearmongering.

49:52.580 --> 49:53.870
The blind man Du used

49:53.870 --> 49:55.430
the tragic deaths of your family

49:55.430 --> 49:56.760
to scare the villagers.

49:57.390 --> 49:59.350
His goal was to raise money
under the guise of

49:59.350 --> 50:01.150
carrying out justice for heaven

50:01.180 --> 50:02.870
and rebuilding the Immortal Temple.

50:02.870 --> 50:04.620
The villagers were beyond terrified

50:04.620 --> 50:07.460
and rushed to donate money
to rebuild the temple.

50:07.980 --> 50:09.580
They couldn't have imagined

50:09.580 --> 50:10.390
that Blind Du

50:10.910 --> 50:12.710
had already fled with the money.

50:13.750 --> 50:15.580
Who is the mastermind...

50:17.980 --> 50:18.830
behind this?

50:20.310 --> 50:21.390
He should be...

50:24.230 --> 50:25.430
Zhang Dancheng.

50:27.620 --> 50:29.100
Zhang Dancheng.

50:33.460 --> 50:34.310
So...

50:36.580 --> 50:37.950
what should I do

50:39.300 --> 50:41.570
to take revenge on Tianxiang Sect?

50:44.810 --> 50:46.600
If you want to take revenge,

50:46.620 --> 50:48.620
you must understand Tianxiang Sect

50:48.750 --> 50:50.460
better than anyone else.

50:50.810 --> 50:51.500
They're ruthless,

50:51.500 --> 50:52.870
but you mustn't fear their ruthlessness.

50:52.870 --> 50:53.460
They're evil,

50:53.460 --> 50:55.460
but we must face their evil head-on.

50:56.100 --> 50:57.230
You must accurately

50:57.460 --> 50:58.830
calculate their every move

50:58.830 --> 51:00.390
and see through their every scheme.

51:00.390 --> 51:01.460
Only in this way

51:02.790 --> 51:03.950
can you get revenge.

51:06.660 --> 51:07.500
Sir,

51:08.130 --> 51:10.190
please accept me as your apprentice.

51:10.580 --> 51:12.240
As long as I can get revenge...

51:14.390 --> 51:16.120
I'm willing to learn anything.

51:47.390 --> 51:47.980
Okay.

51:48.870 --> 51:49.980
From now on,

51:50.700 --> 51:53.630
I, Jin Buhuan, am your mentor,
and you my apprentice.

52:03.120 --> 52:05.330
[In the next episode]

52:11.800 --> 52:14.330
May I ask what manner of hero
I'm dealing with?

52:14.520 --> 52:16.000
Let's talk it out.

52:16.720 --> 52:18.450
This fanfare isn't necessary.

52:18.660 --> 52:19.700
Turf?

52:24.780 --> 52:27.230
Your fate is dominated by
a fierce element of Fire.

52:27.230 --> 52:28.380
Within a month,

52:29.000 --> 52:30.800
your entire family will perish.

52:31.660 --> 52:32.270
Take him out.

52:32.270 --> 52:33.950
Chop him up to feed the dogs.
